        "original_id": "43a7cbdd-8f62-5852-a950-11200a1fa93d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Tucholka\n- Products: Fringeworthy, FTL:2448\n- Companies: Tri Tac Games\n- Topics: role-playing games, science fiction role-playing games\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Tucholka was born on February 9, 1954.\n- Fringeworthy was first published by Tri Tac Games in 1982.\n- FTL:2448 was created by Richard Tucholka and published by Tri Tac Games in 1982.\n- FTL:2448 is a science fiction role-playing game about faster-than-light travel with alien races.\n- Richard Tucholka was a writer, game designer, and publisher best known for helping create the role-playing games Fringeworthy and FTL:2448.\n- Richard Tucholka died on April 27, 2017.",
